      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `562b634ee44a6ce05e01f87c393c564d64bccc4c89fcc0fd23ed6657775d1253--employee-earnings-and-hours-australia-2025-cube-4-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Employee Earnings and Hours, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: May 2025\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 15 of 15\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 6345393acd4fcd69fd61a4172fb427d8ab7ee300514791c9a9c22d2141212206 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 0b65ba118004e6b663dc87077ed41c0c1c254f444a10dedf45d2f3914abc83b7 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | d12063b52ae457754fe9c4e6ae1b53b59fb3ab9e6dd2ae7f3520b5420e16f8f1 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | bf8f8c606b3c38a52e1d076e4cf135d8c7c59af86b0aa7f41e07a9cf1fab991f | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 9d4ad40ac9ebe8174a4619b91eaefe9e2a9b04c5fb97b345cfbe53ee30cd4e42 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 9799b5d85fc2837f6c358c79582dc1f9d91965c1f2ab7f1953d7259e45d3faaf | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | cd0d74b86ae25fdd76f683a329b6e206f001c072941aee84585bf7c367c8dd86 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 986d93332bb2e188849f7f605e3fa87da29686e8d0820a2d5e40d48e0ea780cc | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | c7ffc65c57f3acca2dcb5c6b6885e2becda0451f4663de8ee0f182c25b73eff6 | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | cc4548a06e73a20907823755ab8b61eb72bf98d306fb95cfc3a5d690bd895398 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | 116cec0e6838f34b09c528e73aa6deae74b815c8b9d2913ecca97d0ce3393b9c | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | bcd33fa5c53e6d25e4a411051bb61c53bfa6c3ca0828d956fc2825b5572579c0 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 2da4c7a4fe5d07ead6f8bc9ab28e113c7949fc9a48fc947bad04dfa173447082 | missing |\n| \"Table_13\" | ecb7147151b8d127bfd4efb45cbf6f65372fbd96914f56745f9ef05b21fa036c | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | 66c2acc8ba974daa27e661a9fed5db2d68cdb5b8a9e6e46a2bc14199a8ff79b2 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
